## Scope of this licence

This licence covers only the contents of this repository: the patch in `patches/`, the scripts in
`scripts/` and `tools/`, and the documentation in `docs/`.

It does **not** cover the upstream projects this repository adapts, and no upstream source is
redistributed here:

- **[HybridRobotics/whole_body_tracking](https://github.com/HybridRobotics/whole_body_tracking)**
  — MIT licensed by its authors (BeyondMimic, [arXiv:2508.08241](https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.08241)).
  Clone it yourself and apply `patches/isaaclab3-migration.patch`.
- **[isaac-sim/IsaacLab](https://github.com/isaac-sim/IsaacLab)** — BSD-3-Clause.
- **Isaac Sim** and its bundled extensions — NVIDIA licence terms.

The Unitree G1 robot description files are likewise not included; see the README for the download
command and the licences attached to those files.
